# The API image is built from the repo root; only what `turbo prune` reads needs
# to reach the daemon. Everything else is either regenerated inside the image or
# must never enter it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.env
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/api/src/generated
.git
.github
.claude
docs
out
